  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f059dd874ee7482e127da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是在比赛终盘缩短与前方对手的差距\\n则在最终直线上小幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d30d56583c326eea591b4597fa5ff7d5e6f0ee22bcbf1f11d09f2871cc2bda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eaa358c074fa3d10a2c816f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后处于前列时\\n略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef6e2ebbf8853f6b07d3c1bc76edb96accc8edf9d3168168b6c4f6c5d477bc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900041"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900041"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b961203c16b22f7ebddea213",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘位于前列并突围时\\n在距终点300米时稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d03b2b80ea0117505b856fdb39038dfe549d19b6dd3a80457ecaeee2bce057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900051"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900051"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f08713b7c88e27139045589",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列时\\n能够开辟道路,略微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "697df8c68b2f8cd6cee35afc3e8ccf2771e460554f2c3f95475e15ae43159c1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900061"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900061"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b97ef92ec8d2185242a91a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从比赛中段进行长距离冲刺,速度会一点点加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "08bd5d6276a049f31f4dbe70425fa1e4dc6e613a3b4a3fc614e2f6ca1ad43c8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900071"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900071"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62db3e891dc28cc99b8c9271",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n竞争力变强,速度也会略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "000221a8338cf9b9956fa31752362684f84d9e402ccfaa06e16d24774fe45fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900081"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900081"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744eff0011a7e3a104f82397",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段身处前方的话\\n能发挥让自身成为第一的力量\\n提升速度和加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee204f18900c491fb2edf71eab6a5d2e68ca34ef0f9af7a8134c25990347cbca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900091"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900091"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b180a2898172e7cce348a960",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半处于好位置时会增加动力\\n稍微持续提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "175b6aab5123edeaddd87539e9ceb52cc7698a6c4ce72fee42912f4dd568cafd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900101"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900101"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac057ea96ae4c80dff35104",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会略微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b099dc733397acdd9b99428560756f1b7700512b95dbf59b36ad3c77063db72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fb0c6af138d6fa9e6587bfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从后方绕到外道\\n并且完成赶超时\\n在最终直线上加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0756622ebd68d1c9da205d3f575ebd0916c1e1f0116ae8c5814e5a8c511ddc67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ef4fdafefd4af2d0031a89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道前身处前方时\\n速度稍微提升。如果身处长距离比赛\\n且体力充沛,则速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5632d43998dd9c56fe8fce461cf38c1341bfa29f4b4ba624452c43f800bbfc86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900131"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900131"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df57e4582420973959a1b2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上仍保有余力且处于前列时\\n更容易保持优势",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70da9300d31994bc9b7c502a619d078ec678062580c5abf87e7c723dad26ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900141"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900141"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9636ab078115c59dd939575",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后身处前列\\n并且与前后的赛马娘距离较近时\\n能够稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "573f6e1d9471649c2c798b3a3ad135128162b4e47529fc74108097b160d60bd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900151"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900151"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e561e3e4a3be40d1dd2b89b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后在外道完成赶超时\\n以怪物般的力量稍微提升速度\\n若在中盘争夺过名次,变为少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a872c8c2b1668695c4a8c310ca9746c8eb25a0dbedf87381e024c69b60e56dd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900161"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900161"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb89938e9487b99df883429",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘赶超3次后\\n最终直线上会少量加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1aac799fde576d2b101b03d061b039aa0d3dc48d59b582b66605e43cbfd92f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900171"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900171"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13cd285171a13cfb342e939",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道从中后方赶超时\\n速度稍微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "385992aa63400c65c7fee33350ca221927d630a8e352492f19a4779dad6ad10a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900181"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900181"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411c2a361ce841276940380c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘2次赶超的话\\n能够加快速度\\n且路线选择变得更明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb80d8169d39715fa305d620c8666513a475840d237a97636a5db7e15e22f7f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900191"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900191"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c56c6b79aca02c3a0399ddff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道上处于第一位时\\n稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc2f02806c205719d3b53c9aa3e4bdfac2269a6e89dcbba0e37d3b1988e8f66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900201"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900201"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c8e1b27f7afa316ab3c9e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半段直线若处在好位置\\n或由中间梯队向前冲击时\\n稍微提升速度与加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee1bdbbbbff4093c929c7d343136ad9b18b69364e568b74970a0f4b2c95c38d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2381bb02d213ba6aaed8e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半若处于好位置并进行名次争夺时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6999255f16e6821bb54456f0e2ce59eac8144c9b699f1544ba380491dbeec505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad02966d7a82ff07bef17fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道前位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升。如果比赛全程保持冷静\\n则变为速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8745eec1d759c0035687ab92f61faa578839a3ff4cdb757d17c057c058c1dbd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900231"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900231"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218dba6d8ddaa5f664369824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n在直线上稍微更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "f504e48013dde3e3e2d84fd9a7d093e1363599cca9dde344a0518fc8fba5aa59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de161d790daf407aace7843",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛程后半时\\n由中间梯队稍微提升速度\\n使前方的马娘稍微萎缩",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83a8577a50389f4550be45ee8d9d6d0a6016af04db08535b2624f1395870ee1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900251"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900251"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628687ad4124372bb09cdda6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在没有起步晚的情况下,最终直线上位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升。若是一直保持在靠前位置的话\\n改为速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3a6a38c46a025e879f58e48d42aabc35e3d82548742a1c0444fdbb5e7da657",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900261"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900261"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b532e1275ce48191cde031a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中想要冲向前列时\\n略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc3737c46284579d4cb4c23cb08fa3a8926265fb2f46307ef03443a09564500",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900271"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900271"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c99ee813a8db76a0d56990b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若比赛的中段处于好位置准备超越时\\n速度略微提升\\n若是短距离比赛\\n则效果改为略微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b59bc2d2293574c852ed3d50beabfd3b45ae1fc6f8312b061dd2e26d07ba93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900281"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900281"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b9e4d18f1dca29277a09b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后300米处在前方\\n且与最前方的马娘距离很近或是领头时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c6200d1f28b6b5d619bf60aabccd2938aad70dae13df07c843c075ec939547",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900291"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900291"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55fb58949cb1ace163be8b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越\\n并身处前方集团的话\\n在最终直线上稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b118c96b40435a584383648ddd9bd85593139b1e16d8fe4c76c6e8988fc3cab0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900301"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900301"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56a5891a5b387c8baa7ce89d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300m左右处于前方的话略微提高速度\\n若刚好上完坡\\n则速度稍微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f3a7b2ecc32d50d6f2a1fac911f1542da4bb55f7820155c652aaff27e8c1a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900311"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900311"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7422967610d227f25bc23a9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n稍微恢复持久力\\n且短时间内略微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c020a5267014d20d8b61ab7963d52c6eb851dbbb29909d44f3fec56228f6a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900321"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900321"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e392318ba08d9cb3bc262c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终直线上若与先头集团拉开了距离\\n则会稍微提升速度\\n若身处最后方,提升更多速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b982562769b1b0659e5328486bbcd15de5bad78c25a184f41efea6cf207afb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900331"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900331"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceddb828ef85b8d94759f951",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半,一直位于队伍中后方等待时机的话\\n在名次争夺时,将稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "590bac92f5d2501ac0c79b9f7cec582a03ddee97bb2b790d993e3d5f4c0fecbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900341"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900341"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4afbba1a5f4554755df37b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "784ebd86f19aa257574c781e9a1b3a224954b081d12d34aa580d29e785ea652b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900351"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900351"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921e1dd2ef06103177db3d3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后若处于队伍中部靠近内埒的一侧\\n则会在最终直线上略微提高速度\\n略微容易取得好路线",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d117f53f05ccf8eeb6bb96d89763bbeeaf745cc559bf6aa968c4f19544ae07d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900361"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900361"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c92a80fca7063422f48f13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,并在最终直线上\\n位于第三名以后的话,速度稍微提升\\n若是长时间处于中间集团,改为小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74994077fe8025e184dd9eb7a62b6c901c4598edf364fbbb8d559147b2259c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900371"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900371"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b362c6b315aa1b9d0fb052c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右并处于好位置完成赶超时\\n稍微提升速度与加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5b67fffb3c6e3549566b4d1c2ea59185eb766b9d030de165133ff7819dafef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900381"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900381"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3c0ecb815bac89bc3aaab7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行名次争夺时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fadaad1bdbd4c1867b3c10f7bb298636cda1c3e7cb01775f57e273dc80f14c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900391"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900391"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92f3b373a6aae530d28e074",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半程从队伍中团开始加速追赶前方时\\n速度会持续微量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4138d9b60f4eb52614403bae84c340b69b8964bfaab0564afc44bc9e0df5c092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900401"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900401"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54678a8abd1a346e7394f49e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n速度略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba351a2c2ecf21e8b5f4293d7074239cd4069c27ef228f364fdaac0e3a31efc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900411"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900411"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61303daed55a875f72cbe9a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余200m处自身不在领头位置\\n距离领头4马身以内时速度微量提升\\n距离2马身以内时速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cbf5e80c87ef259577b9d696a1b49bc41f9c1c93a09cf011c6c8bc76dfedb6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900421"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900421"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3650067c5c31bd09559e47be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名次争夺时,速度提高一点\\n若是身处沙土比赛\\n加速度会稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef9445010a7296cd82e8d651bffe52fa484722b6d9edb38b87a3aa4115bf831",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900431"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900431"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f53a6360d11d33995b37a546",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入最终弯道前能一直保持冷静\\n在后方等待机会的话,会在\\n距离终点剩余300m处略微持续提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0250c917321884eb315940974b7f033ece469552b63a1ce85baa117043accc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900441"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900441"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711740b6ae470b5b1ffc2fc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900451"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900451"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e9a63268e78a6b8e894028",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线位于前方\\n并被后面的马娘拉近距离时\\n绝不让步的想法将会稍微化作动力",
      "source_fingerprint": "9107d18709137f425e323c118eaa4b0bfdfb046ad3491586a2270d3ecefd16f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900461"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900461"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51d114e57f69f55aee8954b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘阶段剩余400m处位于前方时\\n速度略微提升,且在GⅠ比赛\\n等大舞台上取得高人气时,速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce84e7e25f7224e6d0315ed303c25f4c855f8b15e54e75de6be54e4634df7f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900471"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900471"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ad8b63927a42c98e9665ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终直线上身处前方\\n完成超越或是即将被超越时\\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7bee98cedb5241f30c44a9c5c8c91cb9e80821bd62a1085241ece84e962e30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900481"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900481"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e4bd14300fa1dafba541d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后准备超越前方马娘时\\n将在剩余400m以后的好位置处稍微提高速度\\n人气较低的时候速度提升稍多",
      "source_fingerprint": "79251654c6857b7cdc6fbbc253fcd6e2ce6321d073ac162d32e405d07212a2f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900491"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900491"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:470bfe23713b78410dafedda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从中间梯队向前突进时\\n稍微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac334a99ee88b6402db9ff62f1b78b0a8458ec98bd77f183b6369914580638aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900501"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900501"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a76cf4ad7db9ef0996449c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘经过弯道竞争\\n且终盘的最终弯道过半后自身占据好位置时\\n稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "65d18b4f50b6a419f82c9a7562eae1883a3b733a8b0f16ad2ba99f04d2316d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900511"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900511"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f473b0f0b252cb3301dd062e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于靠后位置时\\n会看着附近的赛马娘并略微恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "d13127a133d1b1e74e2582b72021f50ac6f75c3240c4d248b951c2921daaf015",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900521"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900521"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81eb2f3972f11a6d00f8982e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘处于最终弯道且身处后方向前逼近时\\n短时间内加速度少量提升,每次超越其他马娘\\n都会增强效果并刷新时间,最多增强三次",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5eab17e3a02b0075ad3e15f1e22ca4ff43ee25e58e0f1e8e4726592611e6fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900531"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900531"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08fa85a5a1af20ed9d41a2fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段若从后方进行了超越\\n剩余150m后自身位于前方时\\n在短时间内速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0693054198602f86d4072c37a7a8eb29f8fc7a774a1cba3f074b19320482aba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900541"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900541"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb9093deeddb2463f9838d7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中场附近位于队伍中间且附近\\n有其他赛马娘时,速度稍微提升\\n如果视野内有4人以上的赛马娘则效果增强",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d062090fa6d2c6c2e506915028964caffcd959314accef316350eb8c6c15e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900551"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900551"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0d43d53f842d2e54ae0a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘前方受阻时\\n能够借助预言之力略微开辟道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "392068c41e40171936a1544e74fc8e16928bdb49a72f54ff19c615cf0e42c92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900561"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900561"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:503fd88b44cb1273c422cda5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛即将进入终盘时的某刻位于后方时\\n速度持续微幅上升。若是在中长距离比赛中\\n距离领先位置越远则效果越强",
      "source_fingerprint": "153a3b32d7d3d9e29c7550c335c62e3d3ad7432ef4710b248cba77f44231ad73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900571"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900571"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76cbbdd8f209800cb0b3d48c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时\\n会稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25db8ee9b60042151d3b8cc7658a57907cda5d3c33bf3375b593cca546faa79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900581"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900581"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f51b4a59e2ca703c1efa76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "保持冷静进入中盘并准备发力时\\n或是在终盘胜负关键的弯道\\n位于中部梯队时,加速能力会略微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "313df5a489db779ff3aa91a3d44fbdcb3aab82f3dec7fb352c66ab60337e4d03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900591"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900591"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba38fc336f5a677479267843",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘处于第三名快要输掉的时候\\n激发潜藏的昂扬斗志,速略微度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba40b6b690b98c482f8cbb0cee5c9d5a416b9f71f7ba0a03d33554dba57153e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900601"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900601"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1b07b7390b721c1d21fe1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够冷静地进行比赛的规划时\\n就能够在最后200米发挥实力,少量加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3c55d0db3d00aced8139cf8733f8efc0f30d606c08e27595503c9728ee70d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900611"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900611"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e6e29e296109b4dc7775e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛程中段前后若处在中间梯队\\n重新恢复精神使持久力略微恢复\\n并且略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "50633153ac23ee555ec3bc1b8911c64b82b67aec6838885f0d4b24292d601a72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900621"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900621"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3d43dab64ef2f34b1bb018",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ff123498eb8c2152e0c56ce97084749d7c5eabc4221c23be08970dc87d9b59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900631"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900631"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e2d31c1bc182b8b56ced6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从起跑到比赛后半程一直保持在前列的话\\n将略微回复持久力\\n且速度一点点上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b30464d502179f34de591d0a7e7f8e83c2eaf19c978d0f73fc8a16d13f97bae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900641"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900641"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293724745482f9adf5492ed6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处位于前方时\\n速度略微提升,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则速度略微持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d853fd76e34cc8763d06d92e8424de7fe9a00487011d67bc3c7339005cd2d7c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900651"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900651"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c6096bf9603a26cc073ea7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘中段处于领头位置时\\n超长时间内速度持续略微上升\\n但终盘末段时会微幅减速",
      "source_fingerprint": "45fa37c7788f39071c7edd1c2663062fabbfb383f55bb7bc193fe511c92e5ae9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900661"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900661"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc008b3d017294338f973b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线且身处好位置时\\n稍微提升速度\\n若是接近领先赛马娘的话,提升更多速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "168f76616019dbd08cda26cffac68cd50484975d64b65f3789e1da6f8c937da8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900671"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900671"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3a7e336b751a31788f30be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "位于先头集团时,在比赛后半的第三弯道处\\n会略微加快速度。或者,在终盘身处看台对面时\\n会更有力地向前迈进",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbaae89405f46cda8c66ab7c0bc65ea34a2c0777783f8d78a85339986bcb4526",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900681"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900681"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017ef028ffc685f292d78aa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余300m处于好位置\\n且与前方赛马娘距离近时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "817510a61bfb21ec05ca7f37680e9b78ccbd0a28e2acd13075930f6789e083fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900691"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900691"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3c9d9fe8dbcc8b0ac18c60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在剩余800m处位于队伍中间时\\n极少量提升加速度,若在2400m的比赛中\\n取得高人气则少量提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "914b0c16ead9bc063c09a87d02ec409412f6eef5b94c056cc9736b043338a2b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900701"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900701"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62220e9135b452f031f0b7e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上和后面的赛马娘距离较近时\\n会瞬间消耗微量的持久力\\n短时间内稍微速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc51a9ef6ea985ffeb37cd08fb7d7447df9eeeeb6333a588135754c779c5a5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900711"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900711"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:764b19c0ef04d2f8c5fe4570",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后完成超车\\n且在最后300米位于前方集团时\\n会燃起烈焰般的斗争心,略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1916561250f8fc17236fa534f985ce6fb1f9e57a4a926a11eefd4970ab9bdfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900721"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900721"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ea5d9851a1115810e407f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘进行超越时\\n在最终直线上速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c68245059c8bfe63a5188cf719e8cfb63dc9df075d789b002fde56cc094a4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900731"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900731"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db625fb6754763815be6ebd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛程后半段身处中团时\\n会根据剩余体力进行相应的长距离冲刺\\n速度逐渐极小幅度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e84ea9a30d9f069f7ab96abe40b0f2093b52410dfbd49362d16f2c8e4fc5bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900741"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900741"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d2854b972c108375e8e71e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛半程处于中间梯队,速度会略微提升\\n若是长距离比赛,速度提升的持续时间将延长\\n并恢复少量体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "98f2ca095b4d1657ad2838c7573ed3a76f366c0a93cda2762d243d014098c434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900761"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900761"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e061394280476adcf1a000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘若位于好位置,则在剩余400m的地方\\n少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "19cca141cab67e468ae9143ff05d9454093a1a05681812e81fba0b27c0303223",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900771"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900771"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f9d08bb9ed02735efa60882",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛程前半段压低节奏,最终弯道后半段\\n若位于前方则可长时间持续极少量提高加速度\\n若处于第2名则效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0833c3bf4a954825ec4866f360120d87cb3f90d689c49f84a4f6c2392dc03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900781"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900781"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f66dc17719672371c75512",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在前方竞争时\\n则比赛后半段短时间内速度稍微提升\\n若是大井、川崎或者船桥赛场\\n则变为速度持续稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1e408f492e07a46c5dd4bb994d3fee20f7773949c852b8812c911df08b1e6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900791"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900791"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2796a7be7cf22cc9592627c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段一直保持前方位置时\\n若后半段检测到对手发动了加速技能\\n则向前极小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "582965c0d92f8cb9f6ee41b67c92257a5cff6d8173e5e627ccde9006073cf1ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900801"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900801"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f46a85428814eca6e7affa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中，短时间内\\n会少量向前冲出＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a379f7c06ed419e55afe6d0fb7216c9c5e65b24ce51fd36d05d3632ceb44173",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900811"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900811"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430cbccadf00a6b8062fb9e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于好位置时\\n短时间内速度稍微提升,若是英里比赛\\n则效果时间增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "af85e1898bee6248c9376c7cdf8591352e78ac340ac1b3b7c45e28982e0369c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900821"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900821"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6693f28c9e836a86c651b5ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近往后的直线处\\n位于队伍中间时,稍微提升速度,若此时为\\n下坡则稍微持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a18c6362cb397b974f58e5f32e8fc12b886d0c5c228092197aa51da925438ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900831"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900831"
    }
  ]
}
